{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Bend the Rules of Gravity</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Using your rotation abilities, navigate through rooms filled with countless creative puzzles by walking along walls, ceilings, and from unusual angles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Every Room is a New Perspective</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This journey will take you to unique rooms. Here, not only your intelligence but also your sense of direction will be tested. Each section will offer a new mechanic, each corner a new perspective. Nothing is as it seems in Flipside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Retro Meets Modern in a Pixel World</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Flipside features a vibrant pixel-art atmosphere enhanced by smooth animations and subtle lighting effects. Retro visuals meet modern design in a world that feels both nostalgic and fresh.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Countless Challenges, Never Repeated</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>With a wide variety of handcrafted levels, Flipside delivers an evolving challenge that keeps your brain engaged. Each stage introduces new ways to play, and no two puzzles feel the same.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Get ready to flip your world. Coming soon\u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921160?t=1754222336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/5d7d74332e0e28ad1ee655e3a3de064adec21d9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754222336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/fdfe6d13517fef2e0b8422bd498e32768d9ce1f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754222336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shar